- Meet at an amusement park
	Matt and Kelp met at WaveWorld amusement park
	Kelp: Hey man, you must be Matt. This place is awesome bro!
	Matt: Hey, Kelp! Yeah, the match maker surprisingly had extra tickets. I thought they looked kinda broke considering they only got a bed.
	Kelp: They’re probably a nepo baby posing as broke, I met so many of them at uni. Enough about that, let's ride the Barracuda Strike! I saw a man puke afterwards. Gnarly.
	Matt and Kelp scream their hearts out on a thrilling roller coaster
	Matt: Okay…that was totally epic #slay. But now the best part, the food! Come on, let me show you the best combinations!
	Kelp: Octo-dog but the bun is a glazed sea donut with caramelized brown algae? Gosh, this is peak. You’re definitely cheffing it up!
	Matt: Mhm, that’s my specialty. This has been super fun! Although, I’m feeling more of a casual vibe between us.
	Kelp: About to say the same, let's run this back another time for sure though!
	After date
	Matt: Kelp is such a cool guy. To be honest, he’s more like a bro to me though. 
	+0 satisfaction. Neither heartbroken, nor fulfilled
